minor_decisions.decision:
Edge styling:
- conditional verified edges: a hollow arrowhead (it stays hollow when focused);
- mismatch edges: the warning colour;
- both carry SVG <title> tooltips and react to the pointer on their stroke only;
- lean-ref edges: thin, drawn only while an end is hovered or selected, and only when no declared or verified arrow already joins the pair.

Lean badge texts:
- 'Lean: not checked yet', 'Lean: checking…', 'Lean: up to date';
- 'Lean: files changed';
- 'Lean: N errors' or 'Lean: check failed';
- 'Lean paused: low memory';
- 'Lean: syntactic mode' (plus a banner);
- 'Lean: off' (plus a banner with the detail).
History action words: add, edit, delete, kind, move, premises, new subject, start, manual edits, undo, redo, revert, initialize.

M0 tests updated where the plan changed them:
- store.test.ts: theseSuffice/addNode/kindChange payloads carry requestId; 'reordering within a column posts nothing' now expects `reorder`; addNode keeps inner whitespace (D-16 verbatim, M0 collapsed it); the old 'new graph keeps selection' test is replaced by AT6.1's;
- theme.test.ts: accepts the M1 colours and explicit per-theme hex defaults;
- board.spec.ts: requestId in kindChange/theseSuffice/addNode payloads; the colour test now covers telelean.vocabulary and telelean.highlight;
- the toDisplayEdges test moved to edges.test.ts and was extended.

